  "id": "italian-chicken-cacciatore",
  "name": "Italian Chicken Cacciatore",
  "subtitle": "Chicken thighs braised in tomato, wine, and herbs",
  "description": "Tender chicken thighs simmer with tomatoes, wine, olives, and fresh herbs for a hearty Italian-style main dish.",
